---
title: State Machine Diagram - Order lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Pending : placeOrder() from Order Summary
    Pending --> Preparing : 10 s elapsed [no manual override]\nor Manager taps "Start preparing"
    Preparing --> Ready : 20 s elapsed [no manual override]\nor Manager taps "Mark ready"
    Ready --> Served : 30 s elapsed [no manual override]\nor Manager taps "Mark served"
    Pending --> Cancelled : Customer taps "Cancel order"\nor Manager cancels
    Preparing --> Cancelled : Manager cancels
    Served --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Pending
        entry: statusTimes.Pending = now
        Any manual change sets manualOverride = true,
        which stops the automatic demo timer.
    end note
    note right of Served
        Final state: elapsed timer stops,
        intervals are cleared.
    end note
